{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_5000_situation", "source_sha256": "ae85ae8b3a040539e479889b23a924c3a34e43aec199998452f6b92306869903", "ja": "雑誌のスナップ撮影", "zh": "杂志抓拍", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_5000_place", "source_sha256": "dec33db4fbb960e1b5ac5f73508a2f0a6137fa74386fdaa4d10cdba1390ceed7", "ja": "商店街（夕方）", "zh": "商店街（傍晚）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_5001_p", "source_sha256": "aea3224828c774efd8c43e57719355e47a121f148dec11a86b221aa4c2821100", "ja": "（今日は星梨花と、雑誌の撮影にやってきた。テーマは\n『放課後の寄り道』で、順調に進んでいる……）", "zh": "（今天和星梨花一起来拍杂志。主题是“放学后的绕道闲逛”，拍摄进行得很顺利……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_5002_022ser", "source_sha256": "07b22431fb41d21293b0b00a098dfb7bb4b8e1a10754130d57efc96e9caf3737", "ja": "えへへ。制服で寄り道するのって、悪いこと\nしてるみたいな気がして、ドキドキしちゃいます。", "zh": "嘿嘿。穿着校服在放学路上顺便玩一会儿，总觉得像是在做什么坏事一样，让人好紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_5003_022ser", "source_sha256": "39c4b6a50b111b0b15015c6080c02105cce120b1283345e664505ec08ac31fc0", "ja": "{$P$}さん。わたしちゃんと、\n学校帰りに遊んでいるみたいに見えてますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。我看起来真的像是在放学后出来玩吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_5004_p", "source_sha256": "832501f2e77c1010a37fdd5489f0d5452396455918db17b0c72fdff5361f8869", "ja": "うん、大丈夫。いい雰囲気で撮れてると思うよ。", "zh": "嗯，没问题。我觉得拍出来的氛围很不错哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_5005_022ser", "source_sha256": "d457d77b767a498dee84e775dbdd9696eed5edb60dc2dc7158f98f92dadbbd24", "ja": "よかったです！　そうしたら……次はどこに行ったら\nいいですか、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "太好了！　那……接下来去哪里比较好呢，\n{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_5006_022ser", "source_sha256": "e2cd0b3761ad18306c8e8ed598d5be74c6f1bba9d83626ec8380f0a9dd26b0bf", "ja": "中学生らしい寄り道をしてみたいんですけど、\nわたし、よくわからなくて……。", "zh": "我想试试看符合初中生风格的顺路闲逛，可是我不太清楚该怎么做……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_5007_p", "source_sha256": "ba82939d6559a8878222e386bb86d4cdf86c3c0c0868ac1d11e597af5d46915b", "ja": "中学生らしく？　うーん、そうだなぁ……。", "zh": "像初中生一样？嗯——让我想想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_5008", "source_sha256": "4c49b597350b38246518f97d2d2fcdaf02295566b773664f6d6b495f2af14fe5", "ja": "ゲームセンター", "zh": "游戏中心", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_5009", "source_sha256": "d8f88728b0f14ac3f7b91ac98ee8fe14997482a7a746dfbe4657bd73ee8862c6", "ja": "ハンバーガーのお店", "zh": "汉堡店", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_5200_p", "source_sha256": "030d027ced0f9dc7babc560a7073189ab9c703ad108e2431873eecd1d324e0e8", "ja": "ゲームセンターを覗いてみるのはどうだろう。\nにぎやかで、楽しいと思うよ。", "zh": "去游戏机厅看看怎么样？\n那里很热闹，感觉会挺好玩的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_5201_022ser", "source_sha256": "4c42b8261fcbde2fbc7e6a2374b8ce4ff090746b516f88db52458d602d10c58d", "ja": "わぁ♪　わたし、シールを作ってみたいです！\nいつもはお友達からもらうばかりなので。", "zh": "哇♪　我想试着做做看大头贴！\n因为平时总是一直收朋友送的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_5202_022ser", "source_sha256": "9fe2d9545a579f7080c3525ce9fdb5021434af3005b970825ee468768b2eef90", "ja": "かわいくアレンジしちゃいますね。\n{$P$}さん、一緒に撮りましょう♪", "zh": "我会把它装饰得可可爱爱♪  \n{$P$}先生，一起拍张照吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_5300_p", "source_sha256": "030d027ced0f9dc7babc560a7073189ab9c703ad108e2431873eecd1d324e0e8", "ja": "ゲームセンターを覗いてみるのはどうだろう。\nにぎやかで、楽しいと思うよ。", "zh": "去游戏机厅看看怎么样？\n那里很热闹，感觉会挺好玩的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_5301_022ser", "source_sha256": "84f9e0c1103b3d73545fdf6ec5b6141542bde8a1afcaf0a203b24610c097da29", "ja": "ゲームですか？　わたし、あまり上手じゃなくて……。\n初心者はお店で狙われるって本当ですか？", "zh": "是去玩游戏吗？我不太擅长……  \n听说新手会在店里成为被盯上的目标，是真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_5302_022ser", "source_sha256": "405743b064a3cb9c116401b1576d5de7cbcaac8e09c38da814e6acb15fc3850f", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん。わたしにも\nちゃんと遊べそうなの、教えてくださいね。", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生。也请告诉我一个我能好好玩的游戏哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_5500_p", "source_sha256": "715b5e57b2d01cb0aad1d833b7948f9a7e686ac651d4baaaf4f0ab7a645ed15a", "ja": "ハンバーガーの店に行くのはどうだろう？\n中学生らしいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "去汉堡店怎么样？\n应该挺有初中生感觉的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_5501_022ser", "source_sha256": "9f16ab2ad457195b744fda3eaf8a0836d66fb5e1db475952efd3ce4c728270c7", "ja": "ハンバーガーのお店ですか！？\nわぁ……わたし、気になっていたんです♪", "zh": "是去汉堡店吗！？\n哇……我一直很想去看看呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_5502_022ser", "source_sha256": "478dd30c74dd643b1e816d5f69b7628b002acd1c43b177df647f0aafa5a22bc2", "ja": "大きなポテトをわけあいっこするんですよね？\n{$P$}さん、早く行きましょう！", "zh": "是大包薯条大家分着吃对吧？\n{$P$}先生，快点去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_5600_p", "source_sha256": "715b5e57b2d01cb0aad1d833b7948f9a7e686ac651d4baaaf4f0ab7a645ed15a", "ja": "ハンバーガーの店に行くのはどうだろう？\n中学生らしいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "去汉堡店怎么样？\n应该挺有初中生感觉的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_5601_022ser", "source_sha256": "279a4aab4f90c8ab7dbe35a94a48e15e1af10acc2a95753a991c231ca38f4ea2", "ja": "いいんですか！　楽しみです♪　……あ、でも。\nハンバーガーのセットって、結構大きいですよね？", "zh": "可以吗！好期待呀♪……啊，不过。\n汉堡套餐的分量，其实挺大的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_5602_022ser", "source_sha256": "0cee365d37d35c85eeae3db85693fe7bdef6e1799c7920685f1d94e78a3edfba", "ja": "たくさん食べたら、お夕飯が……ううん！\nわたし頑張って食べます。応援してくださいね！", "zh": "要是吃得太多，晚饭就……不对！\n我会努力吃完的。请为我加油哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
